docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth
  `PATCH /api/v1/groups/:groupID/invites/:inviteID` — Group owner or site admin; Bearer access token required.
  ## Description
  Updates the invitation expiration time and/or maximum successful uses.
  ## Request
  ### Path Parameters
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group ID. |
  | `inviteID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive invitation ID. |
  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |
  ### Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `expires_at` | `string (date-time)` | No | New expiration; if supplied, it must be in the future. |
  | `max_uses` | `integer` | No | Positive limit, not lower than the current usage count. |
  At least one field must be supplied. Omitted fields remain unchanged.
  ## Response
  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 5,
      "group_id": 42,
      "expires_at": "2027-06-07T14:30:00Z",
      "max_uses": 10,
      "used_count": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-11-04T10:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```
  ## Errors
  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_ID` / `INVITE_INVALID_ID` — Invalid path ID.
  - `400 INVITE_INVALID_PAYLOAD` — Invalid request body.
  - `400 INVITE_NO_FIELDS_TO_UPDATE` — Neither field was supplied.
  - `400 INVITE_INVALID_EXPIRATION` — Expiration is not in the future.
  - `400 INVITE_INVALID_MAX_USES` — Limit is invalid or below current usage.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403 GROUP_OWNER_REQUIRED` — Requester is neither the owner nor an admin.
  - `404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND` — Group does not exist or was deleted.
  - `404 INVITE_NOT_FOUND` — Invitation does not exist in this group.
}